<%# The marker room, moved here from the keyboard's sessions panel. The
    past_life, new_room and marker_sessions handlers are the same globals the
    old panel used; the Clock app is only a new home for the markup. %>
    Back, load and forward step the room's history; Add starts a room and the
    backspace key forgets a marker. The Drawings, Named and Wiper checkboxes
    choose what a room keeps, and #marker_sessions is filled by the Marker
    chunk's own panel. Nothing here is Clock-specific; the tab only gives the
    room a permanent window.

			<span class="room">

				<img class="past_life medium_thumb" direction="rew" src="<%= &subs::icon_for('/icons/prev.jpg') %>" hint="Previous"></img>
				<img class="past_life medium_thumb" direction="load" src="<%= &subs::icon_for('/icons/play.jpg') %>" hint="Play"></img>
				<img class="past_life medium_thumb" direction="ff" src="<%= &subs::icon_for('/icons/next.jpg') %>" hint="Next"></img>&nbsp;
				<img type="button" id="new_room" class="medium_thumb" src="<%= &subs::icon_for('/icons/lymeboard/add.png') %>" hint="Add">
				<img class="life_direction medium_thumb" style="font-size:10px;" src="<%= &subs::icon_for('/icons/lymeboard/backspace.png') %>" hint="Backspace" direction="forget">
				<span id="life" height="56px" style="font-size:26px;" width="56px"></span>
				<br>
				Draw <input type="checkbox" class="" id="drawings_check">
				Named <input type="checkbox" class="" id="room_check">
				Wiper <input type="checkbox" class="" id="windshield_wiper">
				<br>
				<input type="text" class="timed_input add_something" type="room" style="width:300px;" placeholder="Room Name" id="room_name"><br>
				<span id="playbook"></span><br>
				<b>Marker Sessions</b><br>
				<span id="marker_sessions"></span>
			</span>
